\title{Capabilities}
\taxon{Definition}

\import{swarm-macros}

\p{We also assume a globally fixed set of \em{capabilities} \capset.  A capability represents the ability of a robot to do a particular thing: for example, to add, to move, make use of recursive functions, \etc  For each built-in command #c there is a capability \Exc{c} which represents the capability to execute command #c, but there are other capabilities as well.}
